   "notes": "D = max(Lambda^{1/2}, mu_tau); specialized here to the adversarial regime where D = sqrt(Lambda). Probability type not stated in theorem; proof relies on 1-delta events. Appendix boxed result differs: O~((d + sqrt(d d_x)) sqrt(T) + d(C+D)). Remark 5.4: with a=1/2 reduces to O~(d(sqrt T + C + max(sqrt Lambda, mu_tau)))."
